For standard ID filtering, each CAN_ERFFELn register stores one filter element. For extended ID filtering, each pair of CAN_ERFFELn registers stores one filter element.
CAN_ERFFELn registers can only be accessed by the CPU when the FlexCAN is in Freeze mode; otherwise, they are blocked by hardware. The CAN_ERFFELn registers are not affected by reset. They are located in RAM and must be explicitly initialized prior to any reception.
The CAN_ERFFELn registers are not available if parameter ERX_FIFO_EN is 0.</description>
